// GCE / Pro Football Fantasm Classic 1989 — BASIC offensive unit ratings.
// Transcribed spreadsheet source: BASIC LEVEL - PRO TEAM OFFENSIVE UNIT RATIONGS.ods
// Source context: original 1989 PFF First Edition rulebook, Basic Level - Pro Team Unit Ratings (printed p. 10).
// One 1989 TeamSeason, 14 skill keys x offensive line unit (OL) per record.
// Original two-column spreadsheet: skill code (column A), rating (column B).
// These values are transcribed data; original scan cell-by-cell proofing remains separate.
// Do not infer skill semantics from abbreviations alone; source ruleset defines their interpretation.

